Tick(seconds: 5) -> idle
Play(track: "intro") -> playing intro at 0s
Tick(seconds: 3) -> playing intro at 3s
Tick(seconds: 4) -> playing intro at 7s
Pause -> paused intro at 7s
Tick(seconds: 10) -> paused intro at 7s
Play(track: "outro") -> paused intro at 7s
Resume -> playing intro at 7s
Tick(seconds: 1) -> playing intro at 8s
Stop -> stopped
Resume -> stopped
errors:
  cannot Tick(seconds: 5) while Idle
  cannot Play(track: "outro") while Paused(track: "intro", pos: 7)
  the player is stopped
exit: 0
